### Ease of use
- [ ] Configurable tick rate (main.rs:93, currently 250ms)
- [ ] Configurable indicator periods (EMA=9, SMA=20, RSI=14, MACD=12/26/9 baked in)
- [ ] Surface FMP + Claude API keys in setup flow (today: env vars only)

### Future prospects
